  "system": {
    "identifier": "hyuga-one-body-blow",
    "description": "<p>You release Chakra from every Chakra point in the body creating a shockwave originating from you knocking creatures around you away from you.</p>\n<p>First, if you are under any of the following conditions; Grappled, Restrained, or Prone, you immediately end them.</p>\n<p>Next, all creatures of your choice, within 10ft of you must make a Strength saving throw, being knocked prone on a failed save and becoming unable to mold Chakra for until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p>Eight Trigram. The Chakra you release is not only disruptive, but its destructive as well. All affected creatures that failed their saving throw takes 4d8 force damage or half as much on a successful save.</p>",
